{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4001_p", "source_sha256": "ee215af550891971c62b65e05bd552e92d21bbf8a5cfb1582fb16ac2ade59cb6", "ja": "（今日の可奈の仕事は、グルメレポートだ。\n行列ができる事で有名な、パンケーキ店に取材に来た）", "zh": "（今天可奈的工作是美食报导，\n来到知名的排队松饼店来采访。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4002_036kan", "source_sha256": "cb057b66bf18d016275be40bca4d88279645d79a52b1c41716b57319cd85cf60", "ja": "おいしい収録～♪　うれしい収録～♪　\nでもでも～、困った～収録～……♪", "zh": "美味的录影～♪开心的录影～♪\n但是但是～烦恼的～录影……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4003_p", "source_sha256": "69e35e6b98936674df8942682172f81fa3f9580d88905e8d4135b97e9e5c1bed", "ja": "なんで困ってるんだ、可奈？", "zh": "你在烦恼什么，可奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4004_036kan", "source_sha256": "606195b15ce6aaf846f5e9865108ee53061b1459e0b88b6ddbeb6ca4dce919dc", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\n聞いてくださいよ～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n请听我说啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4005_036kan", "source_sha256": "f0a39faf7f4c08a9107cacac7afc07a8ef72f3ce0202c1c737420db09442229a", "ja": "撮影の時に食べるパンケーキ、メニューの中から\n好きに選んでもいいよって言われたんですけど……。", "zh": "工作人员说可以从菜单里选自己喜欢的松饼，\n在拍摄的时候吃，但……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4006_036kan", "source_sha256": "d53fd70f08e0c7e8944596bc8faafe39ab0d25fd8446e73819bfda3692c0e877", "ja": "このお店のパンケーキ、アツアツのフワフワで\nどれもすっごくおいしそうなんですよ～！", "zh": "这家店的松饼，每一种都热呼呼软绵绵，\n看起来超好吃的啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4007_p", "source_sha256": "508a1c8b57258bd39f48bcae661c8c3445fac928a3319fe3a019b71fe523b31d", "ja": "そうか。\nでも、どれもおいしそうなら、よかったじゃないか。", "zh": "这样啊。\n但每一种都很好吃的话，不是很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4008_036kan", "source_sha256": "a2aec9db418ca03a9106940b628158b57b07f913cdefb2d68295ec225b3f8dbb", "ja": "だから、なんとか3つまではしぼりこんだんですけど！\nそこから、ひとつに決めるのが難しくて……。", "zh": "所以我好不容易筛选出了三种！\n还要再从中选出一个实在太困难了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4009_036kan", "source_sha256": "4c69e6de6d4b65ebe13d386369d9a2da3ea8e9a5e10f0b97dc19d0942c1b38eb", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　{$P$}さん、\nこの中から、ひとつ選んでくれませんか！？", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}先生，\n你可以帮我从里面挑一个吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4010_036kan", "source_sha256": "6f713e2ed36789350d3ada0f2ce3b4bcb84dd1a4e72e0a4c03da2913f30294c4", "ja": "それと、残しちゃうといけないので、レポが終わったら\n私と一緒に食べてください！　お願いしま～す♪", "zh": "然后啊，因为不可以剩下，报导结束之后\n请和我一起吃吧！拜托了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4011", "source_sha256": "f875729ac3eaced7c0f1ab9b7689629b3c64b72166b3425d3c117e0f52d4cd1d", "ja": "15段重ね", "zh": "15层松饼", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4012", "source_sha256": "21be3ad52c1d60d13fcf1313249c4834739e9c110b7eaa48a1c12eb242d9943a", "ja": "10段重ね", "zh": "10层松饼", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
