{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4100_p", "source_sha256": "22c3fb1de3488694ea85309cd5ab34cf9a6e76424cce677c092e3299303dcf96", "ja": "じゃあ、この15段重ねのメガ盛りパンケーキで……\nって、ちょっと待った！　15段！？", "zh": "那就选这个15层的超大份松饼……\n等、等一下！15层！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4101_036kan", "source_sha256": "7b80f632d37ebda32c483622526ff007c9ec57245c1b22c78a970ffd2d45bf12", "ja": "わぁっ♪　そうですよね！\n15段パンケーキ、私もすっごく気になってたんです！", "zh": "哇♪就是说啊！\n我也对15层松饼非常好奇呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4102_036kan", "source_sha256": "392853c2cbf35b791c2732259e2f9203941da197194390d4bba21e7c99c9648e", "ja": "ちょっと大きすぎるかな？　って思ったんですけど……\n{$P$}さんが、そう言うなら♪", "zh": "虽然想说是不是有点太大了……\n但{$P$}先生都这么说了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4103_036kan", "source_sha256": "55c2dc38747885b212584d11505f711f3a864fdb3514a6671b740da8e6a9d12b", "ja": "すみませーん！　アツアツのフワフワ～♪\n15枚で、お願いしま～す♪", "zh": "不好意思～！我要点热呼呼软绵绵～♪\n的15层松～饼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4104_p", "source_sha256": "e961b464865585b444f6ca98a5cc9c944d5df5eb62a6011cfaecee768ad02876", "ja": "まぁ、たまにはいいか……。\nでも明日から、しばらく節制だな……。", "zh": "好吧，偶尔吃一下也没关系……\n但明天开始要节制一段时间了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4105_p", "source_sha256": "a1d013cc908ad464e7d5c8a42e35ab4c75ae80291d29f91f0df7c2bc6f929106", "ja": "（15段はカメラ映えするためウケがよく、\n可奈のレポートは、意外にもバッチリ好評価だった！）", "zh": "（15层松饼拍起来效果非常好，\n可奈的报导意外地大受好评！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4200_p", "source_sha256": "39f09bdbe756b481afcef47b138f5113388d35539ecbc4e807ff809d8ad407c1", "ja": "じゃあ、この10段重ねの特盛りパンケーキで……\nちょっと待った！　10段！？", "zh": "那就选这个10层的大份松饼……\n等一下！10层！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4201_036kan", "source_sha256": "1e334fdc5e9790dac1ed2776e9757f5adb4fb18899467663484301d75992c4c0", "ja": "うーん？　そうですね！　お仕事ですもんね、\nこのくらいでちょうどいいですよね。", "zh": "嗯～？对呀！毕竟是工作，\n这个分量正好合适呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4202_p", "source_sha256": "95d2af1ba2671eef4665abcacfac43601e703521d37b5843443a8f2e89e548da", "ja": "ちょうどいいのか……？", "zh": "正好合适吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4203_036kan", "source_sha256": "aa07a5bf899ba861ffed94bfa90bf87f2d5ab88388db0d13704191d3992dff1a", "ja": "15段重ねは、また次回の、お楽しみにしましょうっ！\nふふっ、楽しみだな～♪　フワフワ～♪　パンケ～キ♪", "zh": "15层就留到下次享用吧！\n呵呵，好期待呀～♪软绵绵～♪松～饼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4204_p", "source_sha256": "0117f8cf59b0a1ed0d053982dc79c1bbee7869b398062519697b11a5f6e2bda4", "ja": "（可奈は10枚のパンケーキを、おいしそうに食べた。\n甘い物は別腹だと言っていたけど……）", "zh": "（可奈开心地吃了10层松饼，\n虽然都说甜点是吃到另一个胃啦……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4300_p", "source_sha256": "664dbff87ff90fbd5eeac8d4c25f679e06549b5d9a2ec70a31dd0ac8101389b3", "ja": "じゃあ、この5段重ねのパンケーキにしよう。\nこれなら、俺でも食べられそうだし。", "zh": "那就点5层松饼吧，\n这样看来我也吃得下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4301_036kan", "source_sha256": "ca487855ecbc34f23c88e4781daa7feab8ecc04fa8078f97f318e64c60b7f049", "ja": "え！？\nうう、はい……そうですね、我慢します……。", "zh": "咦！？\n呜呜，是的……就是说呢，我会忍耐的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4302_036kan", "source_sha256": "1d98cafdfee6cfbc7186da4140aeee5f5bbfa0906bf2498785eac837eabbb7d0", "ja": "あの～……せめて、10段にしていいですか……？\nあ、いえっ、やっぱりなんでもないです！", "zh": "那个……可以至少点个10层吗……？\n啊，不，当我没说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_4303_p", "source_sha256": "bdacc4d885f6654e68d1e43a47559e82140e58b4335b5b6b8d92b8d87a919f6d", "ja": "（撮影の後、可奈は少し物足りなさそうだった。\nもっと増やしてあげればよかったかな……）", "zh": "（拍摄结束后可奈看起来有点不满足，\n是不是点多一点比较好啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
